{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e03-scene-05",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "このバカ息子！  (You Foolish Son!)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "ikezawa": "池沢",
    "kaede": "楓",
    "kozue": "こずえ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Locked up after his arrest, Muranishi receives a stormy visit from his mother Kozue, who scolds him at the top of her lungs before whispering that the family relies on his money. Meanwhile in Tokyo, Poseidon president Ikezawa directs an elaborate studio shoot while keeping an executive waiting outside. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "このバカ息子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "死んだら困るぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "おめえの金がねえと生きてけねえかんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "真由美も大輔も私が育てっから。このバカが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "左手の角度がまるで違うじゃないか。それが命だろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "その手の向き一つで意味が大きく変わるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "やっぱりシーツを変えろ。色が違う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "右手に持つバラは永遠の愛と忠誠という意味だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "すべて計算され尽くして描かれている。そこに美の答えが詰まってるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "ご来訪のお客様がお待ちですが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "いいから、しばらく待たせておけ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "社長、よろしいんですか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "このバカ息子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You foolish son of mine!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "死んだら困るぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't you dare die on me, though.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "おめえの金がねえと生きてけねえかんな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without your money, we can't survive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "真由美も大輔も私が育てっから。このバカが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll raise Mayumi and Daisuke myself, you fool!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "左手の角度がまるで違うじゃないか。それが命だろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The angle of the left hand is completely off. That's the whole lifeblood of the shot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "その手の向き一つで意味が大きく変わるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just that single angle of the hand changes the meaning dramatically.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "やっぱりシーツを変えろ。色が違う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Change the sheets after all. The color is wrong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "右手に持つバラは永遠の愛と忠誠という意味だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The rose held in her right hand signifies eternal love and loyalty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "すべて計算され尽くして描かれている。そこに美の答えが詰まってるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is calculated down to the last detail—that's where the answer to beauty lies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "ご来訪のお客様がお待ちですが。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your visiting guest is waiting for you, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "いいから、しばらく待たせておけ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind, let him wait a while.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "社長、よろしいんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'President, are you sure about that?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "このバカ息子！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "死んだら困るぞ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
