      "t": "右手に持つバラは永遠の愛と忠誠という意味だ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "すべて計算され尽くして描かれている。そこに美の答えが詰まってるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "ご来訪のお客様がお待ちですが。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "いいから、しばらく待たせておけ。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "社長、よろしいんですか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "You heard Kozue switch in a heartbeat from disowning Muranishi to whispering that he had better stay alive, followed by Ikezawa demanding calculated perfection in his studio. See you next time.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "さようなら。",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
